# Pairs with NonDisclosure. An existence probe that stops at the policy grant
# reveals another tenant's trees to a reader the enforcer would refuse.
MODULE: ProbeSkipsTenantEnforcer
TARGET: NonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the existence probe does not compose the tenant enforcer
PERTURBS: Probe

--- FIND
        visible == pol /\ actsAsB /\ grantOk
--- REPLACE
        visible == pol
--- END